OL,3,AChristmas toy rush being driven by
OL,4,Asquishies and building sets
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraditional games and stickers are
OL,7,Fhelping to drive a bumper year for toy
OL,8,Fsales, figures show.
OL,10,FThe data comes ahead of the crucial
OL,11,FChristmas run-in for retailers, which
OL,12,Fpeaks at 23 toys sold every second in
OL,13,Fthe UK.
OL,15,FThe number of toys sold up to October
OL,16,Fwas 17% higher than the same period
OL,17,Flast year and growth is at a 10-year
OL,18,Fhigh, according to research company
OL,19,FCircana.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
